OL,3,CMan charged over death of Coventry
OL,4,Cschoolboy Keaton Slater
OL,6,FA man has been charged over the death
OL,7,Fof 12-year-old Keaton Slater in
OL,8,FCoventry after he was extradited from
OL,9,FLatvia.
OL,11,FKeaton died after being hit by a car
OL,12,Fon Radford Road on Friday 14 June 2024.
OL,14,FDolars Aleksanders, 23, was detained
OL,15,Flast month. West Midlands Police,
OL,16,FCrown Prosecution Service (CPS) and
OL,17,FNational Crime Agency (NCA), say
OL,18,Fthey've since worked together to bring
OL,19,Fhim back to the UK.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/3
