CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1786096135
OL,3,CMan charged over death of Coventry
OL,4,Cschoolboy Keaton Slater
OL,6,FThey added the 23-year-old was flown
OL,7,Finto Gatwick Airport earlier today and
OL,8,Fwas then transported to a custody
OL,9,Fblock in the West Midlands.
OL,11,FAleksanders has now been charged with
OL,12,Fcausing death by dangerous driving
OL,13,Ffollowing the fatal hit-and-run
OL,14,Fcollision in Radford Road in June 2024.
OL,16,FHe has been remanded to appear before
OL,17,FBirmingham Magistrates Court tomorrow
OL,18,F(6 August).
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/3
