OL,3,CMan charged over death of Coventry
OL,4,Cschoolboy Keaton Slater
OL,6,FKeaton's parents continue to be
OL,7,Fsupported by specially trained
OL,8,Fofficers. They have been fully updated
OL,9,Faround these developments and we thank
OL,10,Fthem for their patience and support
OL,11,Fduring our investigation.
